OL,3,GNEWSARainbow flag wrapped around castle
OL,4,Afor Pride event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA castle has been wrapped in a rainbow
OL,7,Fflag as part of a town's Pride
OL,8,Fcelebrations.
OL,10,FTotnes Castle was covered by the 150m
OL,11,F(492ft) flag on Saturday as part of a
OL,12,Ffour-day festival.
OL,14,FIt was part of a programme of live
OL,15,Fmusic, art, cinema and family events
OL,16,Fthat have been put together by
OL,17,Forganisers who said they wanted to
OL,18,Freflect Totnes's identity as one of the
OL,19,FSouth West's most creative and
OL,20,Fprogressive towns.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
