OL,3,GNEWSARainbow flag wrapped around castle
OL,4,Afor Pride event
OL,5,
OL,6,FCeri Goddard, from Totnes Pride, said
OL,7,Fthey wanted the event to be a "bit
OL,8,Fdifferent" so decided to have a big
OL,9,Fpublic art event and used "the iconic
OL,10,Fcastle" to show "queer people have
OL,11,Falways been here and we always will
OL,12,Fbe".
